Let $f : X \to Y$ be a separated finite type morphism of quasi-compact
and quasi-separated schemes. Then we obtain a functor
$$
X_{affine, \etale}
\longrightarrow
\left\{
\begin{matrix}
\text{schemes separated of finite type over }Y\\
\text{with \'etale morphisms between them}
\end{matrix}
\right\}
$$
